title: "HackMatch — US-029: Authenticator and Recovery-Code Lifecycle — State Diagram"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f3e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"flowchart":{"useMaxWidth":true,"htmlLabels":true,"curve":"basis","nodeSpacing":38,"rankSpacing":50,"padding":14}}}%%
flowchart TB
    NONE["Not enrolled<br/>Email OTP is the only second factor"]:::identity
    PENDING["Pending setup<br/>Encrypted secret, 10-minute expiry<br/>Setup material shown once"]:::transition
    CANCELED["Canceled<br/>Restart issued a fresh Pending setup<br/>Old enrollment cannot activate"]:::denied
    EXPIRED["Expired<br/>Rejected at or after expiry<br/>Restart issues a fresh Pending setup"]:::denied
    ACTIVE["Active authenticator<br/>One per account<br/>Email OTP still available"]:::success
    CODES["Current recovery set<br/>10 single-use HMAC verifiers<br/>Raw codes shown once"]:::success
    REVOKED["Previous recovery set revoked<br/>Rows kept, codes no longer valid"]:::denied
    REPLACING["Replacement pending beside Active<br/>Old factor and recovery codes stay valid"]:::transition
    PRESERVED["Replacement not activated<br/>Old factor stays Active<br/>Recovery codes unchanged"]:::transition
    ROTATED["Replacement confirmed in one transaction<br/>Old factor Retired, new factor Active<br/>Old set revoked, new set shown once"]:::success
    RETIRED["Turned off: factor Retired<br/>Pending replacement canceled<br/>Recovery set revoked, history kept<br/>Account returns to Not enrolled"]:::internal

    NONE -->|Begin after recent sign-in + current MFA| PENDING
    PENDING -->|Incorrect code| PENDING
    PENDING -->|Restart after refresh| CANCELED
    PENDING -->|Time reaches expiry| EXPIRED
    PENDING -->|Correct 6-digit code before expiry<br/>atomic activation| ACTIVE
    ACTIVE -->|Generate, expected batch must match| CODES
    CODES -->|Regenerate replaces set atomically| REVOKED
    ACTIVE -->|Begin replacement| REPLACING
    REPLACING -->|Wrong code: retry<br/>Restart: cancel old Pending and create fresh Pending| REPLACING
    REPLACING -->|Expiry or failed activation| PRESERVED
    REPLACING -->|Correct code via<br/>replacement confirmation| ROTATED
    ACTIVE -->|Turn off after recent sign-in<br/>email OTP remains| RETIRED

    GUARD["Original confirm path refuses a pending<br/>replacement, so codes cannot skip rotation"]:::warning
    STORE["Persistence detail<br/>authenticator_enrollments holds lifecycle rows;<br/>authenticator_recovery_codes holds verifiers"]:::internal
    GUARD -.-> REPLACING
    STORE -.-> ACTIVE

    classDef identity fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px;
